message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "UFC Blast Wave Calculator"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python tool that converts the chart-based blast-loading
  content of UFC 3-340-02 into a tested, spatially resolved reference
  generator for facade blast loads.
type: software
authors:
